    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "memories dont really help though. they just remind me of what i lost. everything feels so heavy and empty at the same time. like i'm just waiting for something to end. do you think people are actually meant to survive this kind of thing? it feels so unnatural to keep going when the person who made life worth it is just... gone.",
