    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i dont want to be a monument for him. i dont want to just \"carry the fire\" while i'm dying inside every single day. it feels so lonely. we were supposed to be together, forever. it doesn't feel right that he's in one place and i'm here, just drifting. part of me feels like i'm just a shadow that's supposed to follow him.",
